  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">INGALL Site Protection and Palm Date Cultivation Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will be used to address the loss of cultivation areas and increase farmers revenues through the construction of protection dikes and dry stone gabions along the left bank of the Kori bordering the market gardening site of Ingall. Funds will also be used to promote the production of a new variety of date palm trees.</narrative>
  </description>
